d","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§9.3, p. 225; scan 233; local configuration representation"},{"key":"source_status","html":"book-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"§9.3, p. 225; scan 233; local configuration representation"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"book-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"outside-third-edition"},{"key":"third_edition_relation","html":"新版之外的拓展；保留真实旧版或独立文献来源，不归入第三版正文。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> 为输入字母表。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 为候选八元组；结构定义后固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,\\lhd,\\rhd,F)\">\\(B=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,\\lhd,\\rhd,F)\\)</span> 有效，端标记互异且不在输入字母表中。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in\\Sigma^*\">\\(w\\in\\Sigma^*\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=|w|\">\\(n=|w|\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,q\\in Q\">\\(p,q\\in Q\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,T&#39;\\in\\Gamma^{n+2}\">\\(T,T&#39;\\in\\Gamma^{n+2}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h,h&#39;\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n+1\\}\">\\(h,h&#39;\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n+1\\}\\)</span>。有限词与闭包见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"25902d0bd75ea963\" href=\"?note=25902d0bd75ea963\" title=\"73-df-finite-path-closure\">73-df-finite-path-closure</a>。方向值为整数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"-1,1\">\\(-1,1\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}linear\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}automaton}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{LBA}_{\\Sigma}(B)\\leftrightarrow\\exists Q\\;\\exists\\Gamma\\;\\exists\\lhd,\\rhd\\in\\Gamma\\setminus\\Sigma\\;\\exists\\delta:Q\\times\\Gamma\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Q\\times\\Gamma\\times\\{-1,1\\})\\;\\exists q_0,F\\;[&amp;B=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,\\lhd,\\rhd,F)\\land0&lt;|Q|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Gamma)\\\\&amp;\\land\\Sigma\\subseteq\\Gamma\\setminus\\{\\lhd,\\rhd\\}\\land\\lhd,\\rhd\\in\\Gamma\\land\\lhd\\ne\\rhd\\land q_0\\in Q\\land F\\subseteq Q\\\\&amp;\\land\\delta:Q\\times\\Gamma\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Q\\times\\Gamma\\times\\{-1,1\\})\\\\&amp;\\land\\forall q\\in Q\\;[\\delta(q,\\lhd)\\subseteq Q\\times\\{\\lhd\\}\\times\\{1\\}\\land\\delta(q,\\rhd)\\subseteq Q\\times\\{\\rhd\\}\\times\\{-1\\}\\\\&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall a\\in\\Gamma\\setminus\\{\\lhd,\\rhd\\}\\;\\delta(q,a)\\subseteq Q\\times(\\Gamma\\setminus\\{\\lhd,\\rhd\\})\\times\\{-1,1\\}]].\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}linear\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}automaton}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{LBA}_{\\Sigma}(B)\\leftrightarrow\\exists Q\\;\\exists\\Gamma\\;\\exists\\lhd,\\rhd\\in\\Gamma\\setminus\\Sigma\\;\\exists\\delta:Q\\times\\Gamma\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Q\\times\\Gamma\\times\\{-1,1\\})\\;\\exists q_0,F\\;[&amp;B=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,\\lhd,\\rhd,F)\\land0&lt;|Q|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Gamma)\\\\&amp;\\land\\Sigma\\subseteq\\Gamma\\setminus\\{\\lhd,\\rhd\\}\\land\\lhd,\\rhd\\in\\Gamma\\land\\lhd\\ne\\rhd\\land q_0\\in Q\\land F\\subseteq Q\\\\&amp;\\land\\delta:Q\\times\\Gamma\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Q\\times\\Gamma\\times\\{-1,1\\})\\\\&amp;\\land\\forall q\\in Q\\;[\\delta(q,\\lhd)\\subseteq Q\\times\\{\\lhd\\}\\times\\{1\\}\\land\\delta(q,\\rhd)\\subseteq Q\\times\\{\\rhd\\}\\times\\{-1\\}\\\\&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall a\\in\\Gamma\\setminus\\{\\lhd,\\rhd\\}\\;\\delta(q,a)\\subseteq Q\\times(\\Gamma\\setminus\\{\\lhd,\\rhd\\})\\times\\{-1,1\\}]].\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}linear\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}automaton}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{BConf}_{B,w}\\coloneqq\\{(q,T,h)\\in Q\\times\\Gamma^{n+2}\\times\\{0,\\ldots,n+1\\}:T(0)=\\lhd\\land T(n+1)=\\rhd\\land\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\;T(i)\\notin\\{\\lhd,\\rhd\\}\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}linear\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}automaton}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{BConf}_{B,w}\\coloneqq\\{(q,T,h)\\in Q\\times\\Gamma^{n+2}\\times\\{0,\\ldots,n+1\\}:T(0)=\\lhd\\land T(n+1)=\\rhd\\land\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\;T(i)\\notin\\{\\lhd,\\rhd\\}\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}linear\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}automaton}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}(q,T,h)\\to_{B,w}(p,T\\prime,h\\prime)\\leftrightarrow\\exists b\\in\\Gamma\\;\\exists d\\in\\{-1,1\\}\\;[&amp;(p,b,d)\\in\\delta(q,T(h))\\land h\\prime=h+d\\\\&amp;\\land\\forall i\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n+1\\}\\;((i=h\\Longrightarrow T\\prime(i)=b)\\land(i\\ne h\\Longrightarrow T\\prime(i)=T(i)))].\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}linear\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}automaton}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}(q,T,h)\\to_{B,w}(p,T\\prime,h\\prime)\\leftrightarrow\\exists b\\in\\Gamma\\;\\exists d\\in\\{-1,1\\}\\;[&amp;(p,b,d)\\in\\delta(q,T(h))\\land h\\prime=h+d\\\\&amp;\\land\\forall i\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n+1\\}\\;((i=h\\Longrightarrow T\\prime(i)=b)\\land(i\\ne h\\Longrightarrow T\\prime(i)=T(i)))].\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}linear\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}automaton}\\vdash\nR_{B,w}\\coloneqq\\{(C,D)\\in\\operatorname{BConf}_{B,w}^2:C\\to_{B,w}D\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}linear\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}automaton}\\vdash\nR_{B,w}\\coloneqq\\{(C,D)\\in\\operatorname{BConf}_{B,w}^2:C\\to_{B,w}D\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}linear\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}automaton}\\vdash\nL(B)\\coloneqq\\{w\\in\\Sigma^*:\\exists C\\in\\operatorname{BConf}_{B,w}\\;[\\pi_1(C)\\in F\\land((q_0,\\langle\\lhd\\rangle w\\langle\\rhd\\rangle,0),C)\\in\\operatorname{RTC}_{\\operatorname{BConf}_{B,w}}(R_{B,w})]\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}linear\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}automaton}\\vdash\nL(B)\\coloneqq\\{w\\in\\Sigma^*:\\exists C\\in\\operatorname{BConf}_{B,w}\\;[\\pi_1(C)\\in F\\land((q_0,\\langle\\lhd\\rangle w\\langle\\rhd\\rangle,0),C)\\in\\operatorname{RTC}_{\\operatorname{BConf}_{B,w}}(R_{B,w})]\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><strong>版本归属：新版之外的拓展。</strong> 本条不作为所提供第三版 PDF 的正文陈述；原始来源以 source_id/source_ref 为准。</p>\n<p>实际输入不含端标记，初始带中显式加入两端标记；这是原书把端标记放在机输入字母表后的等价接口重排。带头不能离开有限区间，标记不可被覆盖或在内部新造。接受是有限路径存在，不预设所有非确定性分支都停机。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-path-closure","s